WEBVTT

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:04.400
And so, let's all have a listen.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.150
Dear Hell...

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.450
Jigoku mitai ni asobitai
I want to have a good time like Hell

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:19.580
Jigoku mitai ni yasumitai
I want to rest like Hell

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.420
Jigoku mitai na nidoneshite
I want to go back to sleep like Hell

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:29.000
Teiji de agaritai
And finish work on time

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.840
Jigoku mitai ni tabesugite
I ate too much like Hell

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:39.560
Jigoku mitai ni nomisugita
I drank too much like Hell

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:44.850
Aa sonna wake de
Ah, for these reasons

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:50.110
Jigoku mitai
It's like Hell

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:52.530
Sonna toki koso deban desu
At such a time it's all the more his turn on stage

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:55.200
Hoozuki-sama ga moriageru
Mr. Hozuki livens things up

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.280
Omakase kudasai!
Please leave it to me!

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:02.870
Aa jigoku jigoku mainichi jigoku
Ah, Hell, Hell, every day Hell

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.460
Jigoku jigoku
Hell, Hell

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.130
"Uso desho?!"
"You can't mean that, right?!"

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:13.050
Jigoku jigoku youkoso jigoku
Hell, Hell, welcome to Hell

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:13.880
Atchi muite
Look that way

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:14.470
Kotchi muite
Look this way

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:15.590
Abikyoukan!
Pandemonium!

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.010
Gongo! Doudan!
What the hell!

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.760
Shitsureishimashita!
Pardon me!

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:23.770
Sonna kanji no
In that kind of way

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:27.850
A! Jigoku desu! Jajajajan!
Ah! It's Hell! Ta ta ta-da!

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:28.860
Katsu!
Curses!

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:35.280
CROW-TENGU POLICE DEPARTMENT

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:37.070
Yes, hello, this is the Crow-Tengu Police Department.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:40.660
Has there been a disturbance with monsters?
An incident with ghosts?

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.330
Ah... Another silent phone call.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.000
Lots of those lately, huh?

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.920
So now even Hell has some idiot
phoning the police with prank calls?

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:58.090
If this is all just a prank, then it's extremely annoying.
We can't let them get away-

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.720
Hello, you've reached
the Crow-Tengu Police Department!

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.480
Listen up! You better cut it-

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:11.810
Is Yoshitsune Kuro Minamoto there...?

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:15.070
My name is Princess Takiyasha.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.530
The Man Who Learned from Yokai
and the Woman Who Makes Use of Yokai

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:25.660
I see.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.250
So this Princess Takiyasha character
incessantly calls the police station,

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:34.710
but she always just hangs up without saying anything.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.550
Why not try tracing the calls?

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.970
The phone we use at the department... is this here.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.680
It's possible to run a trace
even with a phone like that, you know.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:48.560
In general, it's more often the case

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:52.230
that we'll detect an eerie atmosphere and look into, so
the Crows aren't very used to working with appliances.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.690
Speaking of Princess Takiyasha,
a certain something comes to mind...

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.150
She's the daughter of Masakado Taira.

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.530
Note: An alternate reading of the "Taira" kanji.
In other words, she's a Heishi.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:07.080
Note: Likewise, "Minamoto" can also be read as "Genji."
On the other hand, you are a son of the Genji
clan who has learned the teachings of the Crow-Tengu,

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.750
and thereby acquired wondrous arts of war.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.460
It's like a peculiar sort of Genpei War, isn't it?

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.960
Please don't put it like that.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.800
Nowadays, the all that Genji
and Heishi stuff is of no concern.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.510
Besides, Princess Takiyasha
is from a whole different era.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:28.220
Still, throughout Japan the Genji and Heishi
carry the image of being opposed to one another.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.730
Like the south pole and north pole.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.810
KOGA
IGA

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:32.690
Like the Iga and Koga.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.060
MINAMOTO
TAIRA
Takenoko no Sato
Kinoko no Yama

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.940
Like Kinoko and Takenoko.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.150
Something feels off about that last comparison!

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.610
Well, never mind...

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:44.160
Actually, I, as a mere priest,
don't know much about Princess Takiyasha either.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.660
With this print to jog your memory,
perhaps you do know her...

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:52.080
It's Kuniyoshi Utagawa's "In the Ruined Palace at Soma."

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:55.080
This here is Princess Takiyasha.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.340
In order to get revenge for her father...

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.550
Note: "The hours of the Ox (1:00 – 3:00 a.m.) known as the ideal time to
cast a curse.
she made a pact with the with the Ushi no Koku god...

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:09.100
I'll get revenge! I'll get revenge! I'LL GET REVENGE!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:13.020
I like your spirit of yours!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.520
Receive my power!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:24.950
...and she became a sorceress.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:32.660
PRINCESS
TAKIYASHA
OYA
TARO
MITSUKUNI
YASHAMARU
KUMOMARU

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.870
By the way, she went on
to cause a disturbance along these lines.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:38.250
Well, leaving aside the sorcery, her prank calls
amount to interference with your duties.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.050
As a police officer,
what course of action do you wish to take?

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:45.260
Well... it seems she was trying to summon me...

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.680
Is Yoshitsune... there?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.520
Er...

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.440
As the same pattern of events repeated,

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:04.070
I began to get an idea of her intentions,
although I almost wish I hadn't...

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:08.740
Princess Takiyasha went through a lot in her life
and also performed memorial services for the dead,

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.790
so she received a reduced sentence
at her trial held by the Ten Kings.

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.910
After serving her sentence, if I remember right...

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:19.000
I believe I heard her name mentioned somewhere
in the vicinity of Mortal Hell...

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.460
I'm glad I consulted you!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.840
Do you have any more details?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:27.220
I believe I could find more out
if I was to look into the matter...

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:33.220
but this the kind of thing where it would be far quicker
to ask some miscreant tipster.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.480
HANA KAPPO KITSUNE GOZEN

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:47.530
Princess Takiyasha, huh? I know of her.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.780
Yep, I know her.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.530
What is it you wanna know?

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.370
Well, can you feed me some info first?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:57.920
Mr. Hozuki, perhaps about someone who was exposed
for their shady spending of public funds?

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.540
Then, at the press conference they cried-

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:04.550
I-I-I was just kidding! I'm sorry, okay?!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.600
Speaking of Princess Takiyasha, even the foxes
accept that she has the upper hand on them.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:13.890
They wouldn't want to end up under her control, after all.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.980
Where exactly can we find her?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.440
Her place is out past the far end of that back alley.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.400
What are you planning to do?

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.030
Lord Yoshitsune is searching for her.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:26.530
A police officer?!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.490
In that case, can't tell you any more than I already have!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:33.870
The back alleys have gambling dens, loan sharks,
and a range of unsavory characters, after all.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.450
This place is frequented by those kinda lowlifes.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.170
No one's doing anything all that bad,

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:44.340
but there are still some things that'd be hard to do
with Lord Yoshitsune hanging around.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.840
I don't wanna get mixed up in this.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:51.890
He's dealing with a troubling situation
both as a police officer and as a private citizen,

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.510
so we're just asking for your cooperation.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:54.850
What do you mean?

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:59.600
It seems this woman who introduces herself as a
princess keeps making prank calls to Lord Yoshitsune,

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.190
in which she just mumbles.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.770
Oh, come on, there could only be
one reason for that, right?

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:08.440
I guess guys with flashy appearances
have it pretty tough, huh?

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.410
FIRST-TIME
CUSTOMERS
NOT WELCOME

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.010
She's generally always somewhere around here.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:31.340
Make sure not to mention my name, alright?

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:34.100
It'd cause me lots trouble
if I'm barred from the neighborhood.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:34.800
See ya.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.980
Pardon me!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:44.940
Princess Takiyasha, are you in there?

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:49.030
I, Yoshitsune Minamoto, have come to pay you a visit!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:57.580
Uh, in other words, the police are here!
Can you please stop making those prank calls?!

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:02.580
We're unable to take reports
from ordinary citizens who are truly in trouble!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.420
Princess!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:13.760
Down below there's a pasty pipsqueak,
hulking monk, and black-clad demon calling for you.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.220
Wait...

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.720
Want us to drive them away?!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.390
Wait, just hold on a minute! I never got word
he'd just show suddenly like this!

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:24.270
Seems a there's a big fuss up there all of a sudden...

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.770
It appears she's not coming out, huh?

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.530
I thought we'd be able to talk things over
without having to force our way in there...

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:33.950
PRINCESS!

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.870
If you like him, just cut to the chase and tell him so!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:40.080
Before rumors spread that Princess Takiyasha
has fallen for Yoshitsune Kuro

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.790
and is stalking the hell out of him!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.590
Buddy, are you familiar with the word "delicacy"?

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:53.130
Well, you should familiarize yourself
with the phrase "interference with one's duties."

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.590
I had no intention of playing pranks.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:59.640
But, each time I call I don't know what to talk about,
so I end up hanging up!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.350
You shouldn't be phoning the police like that
in the first place.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.730
What the hell kind of mediator do you think you are?!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:11.030
When Mr. Hozuki's around, for better or worse
the discussion moves along quickly.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.860
Well, I'll get right to the point: What started all of this?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.490
Please explain within three minutes.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.910
You sure like to press the issue, huh, buddy?!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:23.370
Fine, I get it. I'll tell you, so just hold on a second.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:29.590
Never before had someone stolen my heart like he did...

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.380
It was...

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:37.380
at a summer festival the year before last.

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:42.220
HELL
BON
FESTIVAL
SPONSORED BY
THE OFFICES
OF ENMA

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.560
HELL
BON
FESTIVAL
SPONSORED BY
THE OFFICES
OF ENMA
NOW UNDERWAY

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.140
SO CUTE!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:49.560
You have absolutely perfect features in my eyes.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.320
Can't say I'm happy to hear that from you...

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:58.030
No, really. Even if your personality turns out to be crap,
your looks make up for everything!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.450
He's just too amazing - what am I to do?

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.660
How rude!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.830
He may have killed hundreds of people,
but he's good guy at the core.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.580
Please refrain from saying anything
that could be misinterpreted.

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.540
All samurai kill people.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.130
Seeing you in the flesh like this is just too much for me!

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:21.720
Still, no matter how much you are my type, we are still
a Genji and a Heishi - like Romeo and Juliet.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:23.970
Like a police officer and a hoodlum.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.560
Like Kinoko and Takenoko.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.470
TAKENOKO NO SATO
KINOKO NO YAMA

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.060
Why does everyone bring that up as an example?!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:31.810
Besides, we both have yokai legends associated with us.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:34.480
It's crazy how much this feels like destiny.

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:36.690
This girl...

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.780
The Princess has said enough already!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.030
Just go on and date her, dandy boy!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:44.240
Hey, I never mentioned doing THAT,
but I'd certainly be up for it!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.330
Well, uh...

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.250
I have a lawful wife.

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:55.050
As was common practice during your era,
you also have a concubine, don't you? Well, two actually.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.880
Appearances can be deceiving, huh?!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.380
HA HA
HA HA
HA HA

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:02.720
Out of everyone here, you're the one who lead
a life most contrary to his outward appearance!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:03.720
Pardon me!

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.390
In any case, this situation is bothering me.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.230
Please find another guy.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:09.890
Isn't there anyone suitable around here?

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:13.440
If I'm forced to say, I suppose there is.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:16.940
Hearing her say that so frankly
unexpectedly hurts a little...

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:22.030
Still, I really do have a soft spot for flashy,
handsome young men.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:26.410
I'm honestly surprised myself how much
of a sucker I am for good looks.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.250
Perhaps it's because I've spent too much time
around yokai and my incompetent followers.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:33.040
All the same, something so hopeless
is simply out of the question.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.630
Hey! What exactly is "hopeless" about the Princess?!

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:36.750
Think before opening yer mouth!

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.550
I'd even be fine being your concubine...

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.590
That would spell trouble...

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:46.720
We've been listening for a while now. How dare you
trouble our young master! You miscreants!

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.770
Yikes! When did my subordinates get here?!

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.520
They've stormed the place without an arrest warrant!

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:54.270
The likes of you Crows best not defy the Princess!

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:58.860
Don't bother our young master! Or else Sojobo
will lose his temper and go on a rampage!

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:01.900
What's that?! On the contrary,
if you keep causing trouble for the Princess,

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.570
our boss Taira Masakado will snap
and put a curse on you like you wouldn't believe!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:09.120
Oh, that's right! I have to introduce Papa!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.080
Papa! My boyfriend came over, so come and say hello!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.960
Stop! Don't summon your papa!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:17.380
Excuse us, there's no ill will
between us and your daughter.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.340
Quickly capture him and make 'em
go through with a marriage ceremony!

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.470
Shut up! We'll hear what you have to say
down at the station!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.090
Round 'em all up!

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:27.050
We haven't caused you trouble yet, but just you wait!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.690
Get outta here, you bastards!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.570
It's turned into a Genpei-Yokai War.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.320
What the heck is this?

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:57.250
It appears there's some kind of uproar.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:00.340
There's a bit of a dispute out back, it seems.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.840
Well, is it a fight?

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:07.590
Fights often break out in Mortal Hell,
after all. Just like Edo, isn't it?

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.350
Note: A nod to the proverb "Fights and fires are Edo's flowers."
Fights and fireworks, huh?

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.020
It's a problem, alright.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:16.350
Even outside of the execution grounds,
when a commotion gets too big,

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:21.570
it's necessary to report it
to Mr. Hozuki and the Crow-Tengu Police.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:25.650
So who could it be that's causing all this trouble...?

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:32.490
Mr. Hozuki and the Crow-Tengu Police
are part of the scuffle?!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.120
What in the world are they doing?!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:40.340
To be precise, it's actually Lord Yoshitsune
and Princess Takiyasha who are quarreling, it seems.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.550
Come on, fight, fight!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.050
Meow, meow, meow, meow!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:45.880
Please don't fan the flames, okay?

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:50.600
If Yoshitsune is a no-go, how about making
that black-clad demon one of your underlings?

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:54.310
Let's make a pact with him. He seems pretty strong.

00:13:55.230 --> 00:14:00.150
Setting aside whether or not to give up
on Lord Yoshitsune, that's not such a bad idea.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:05.990
No way. What merit is there for me
to make a pact with you in the first place?

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.780
I'll provide you with food, clothing, shelter,
and some treasure to boot.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:09.740
Don't need it.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:14.750
Oh, come on. Would you prefer a virgin or something?
That's being a bit selfish if you ask me.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:19.500
You... seems to have the wrong idea
about demons in general.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.090
I guess it's the case that humans often do.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.630
You don't need that stuff? Not even the treasure?

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.090
Let me tell you something:

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.800
There are plenty of yokai who have no interest
in girls or treasure and the like, okay?

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:31.760
Is that right?!

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:35.470
That's generally what the yokai I entered
into a pact with were after, you know.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:39.060
All that means is that such yokai also exist.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.810
The Princess'll take good care of you, ya know.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.320
She'll give you alcohol and spending money.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:46.070
Every single day here is quite amusing, eh?

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:46.690
Yeah.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:50.950
We could actually use some affable guys like you
down at the Personnel Department...

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:52.830
"Personnel"?

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:55.200
Do you work for a company or something?

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.750
Well, you could say that.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.580
Not a chance! Working at a company
means you've already lost!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.710
I don't wanna be tied down! I don't wanna work overtime!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.340
So you're currently unemployed, huh?

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.840
I'm not unemployed! I have the job
of running the show around these parts!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.470
What about your employee benefits?!

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:13.010
That's of no concern to me! I'm dead, after all!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.970
Excuse me, Princess...

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.850
Oh, little old me?

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:19.230
I think you ought to at least do as he suggests.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:23.190
This demon god here, isn't just a regular
company employee, you see...

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.270
Is he one of THOSE guys?

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:27.610
He doesn't have the look of someone
with a respectable occupation, after all.

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:31.910
Do you not remember your trial?
You don't watch the news?

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:35.740
I don't watch TV or anything, but I do enjoy
reading material such as classical story books.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.160
Bakin's latest book was fantastic!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.200
THE
EIGHT
DOG
CHRONICLES

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:43.630
This demon god is in fact
the First Chief of Staff to Great King Enma.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.710
A subordinate of Enma?!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.010
Princess...?

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:53.050
What's the matter?

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.470
I remembered...

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.600
This guy...

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.640
Ah, a long time ago...

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.270
Something happened between you two, didn't it?

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.850
Yes... In fact...

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:10.030
It was just before I was about to avenge my father...

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:15.320
If I follow this handbook
of the Ushi no Koku god to the letter,

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.910
I'll be able to summon just about anything!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.620
Come forth!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:21.620
Yokai!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.750
Nekomata!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.040
Furi!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.750
Koroka!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.050
Nobusuma!

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:35.640
With these yokai at our disposal,
we won't be defeated so easily!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:42.140
However, even with all this riffraff gathered here,
in the end we're a mere undisciplined mob.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.810
I'd sure like some kind of decisive monster on our side...

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.270
DEMON GOD

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.820
FROM HERE ONWARD,
YOU'LL FIND FORBIDDEN TECHNIQUES.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:52.360
"From here onward, you'll find forbidden techniques."

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.370
The spell for calling forth a demon god of Hell!

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:01.500
This spell is very powerful,
but if the sorcerer's ability is lacking,

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.750
this forbidden technique must not be used.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.170
Even the strong should avoid using it if possible.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:10.090
Hmm, by its nature the Ushi no Koku curse...

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:13.630
summons the demon god who bears
the most deep-seated grudge at the time of its use...

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:19.010
"Currently, Hell's most cursed demon
is seriously bad news.

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.470
You'll be in for lots of trouble, so I can't recommend this."

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:24.430
BY
THE USHI NO KOKU GOD

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:24.350
"By the Ushi no Koku god."

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.230
Well, why not?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.230
I'll summon 'em!

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.490
Come forth! Demon god of Hell!

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:45.620
Huh?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.420
So you opened Pandora's box, huh?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:49.960
I did, indeed.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:58.140
This is the seal of the Ushi no Koku.
So you must be a wielder of yokai, huh?

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:01.600
Th-that's right! And now I'm going
to get revenge for my father!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.970
Help me do it, Demon god of Hell!

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.980
Become my servant and let us depart
for the Imperial Court!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.100
Why?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.780
And then we proceeded to negotiate on and on.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:22.780
I believe that I summoned him before sunrise and
we continued to negotiate until the sun went down...

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:27.580
Huh? Summoning a demon like that
doesn't automatically make him your underling?

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:30.210
Well, wouldn't that be convenient if that's how it worked?

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.460
After summoning one, you need to use
your conversational skills to negotiate.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.340
In all things, communication is key, right?

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.300
You've gotta do a good job of persuading him!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:41.090
It's like in D*gon Quest when you show your appreciation
to someone for coming when you use "Call Friend"!

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:44.560
So yokai-wielders are basically
just making use of multiplayer?!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.100
But, it was no use...

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:51.190
No matter what I said, I was unable to persuade him...

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:55.190
Ah... I'm remembering it more and more vividly now...

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:59.910
It's an incredibly... tiring... memory...

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:04.660
Well, it's just as I told you at the time:

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:09.830
as a Hell minion, especially one who's involved in
trials, it'd be bad if I took part in a revenge plot.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:13.420
Beyond that, the pact wouldn't be
of any merit to me personally.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:18.510
Yes, it turned out that I was the one who got persuaded.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:25.220
Ultimately, my revenge plot ended in failure,
and I ended up going to where my father was.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.180
I came so close!

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:32.980
If only I had been more skilled as
a conversationalist and sorceress back then...

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:40.360
They say that if your powers of sorcery aren't very strong,
you'll end up losing to the very monster you summoned...

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:46.790
So when the Ushi no Koku god said, "it'll be all kinds
of trouble," he meant in terms of the labor required.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.960
We've gotten a bit off track...

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:53.040
For today at least, just head home.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:57.250
Lord Yoshitsune, sometime later
I'll try for a fresh start with you.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.630
So you're not just giving up, then...

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:05.010
Please don't call the police station anymore at least.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:11.230
I won't. I'll do my best to get you
to give me your personal number.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:14.480
For now, I'll work on dealing with my memories...

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.070
I'm feeling blue for the first time in quite a while.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:21.990
Good. Seems things have settled down for now.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.080
Well, I'll be going now.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.540
Thank you for everything.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.880
"The demon god with the most
deep-seated grudge in Hell," huh?

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:42.380
I wonder if Mr. Hozuki would appear again
if that same summons was tried now...

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:47.720
Well, I would think so. A curse god, he is.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:49.470
I wonder about that.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:57.440
I'm a dead man who took his own life
as I was surrounded by various grudges.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.070
Furthermore, before committing suicide,

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.860
I had no choice but to personally
take the lives of my wife and child.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:07.320
Frankly, that chagrin is something I'm unable to forget.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:08.410
Frankly, that chagrin is something I'm unable to forget.
I won't let you near him!

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:09.910
I won't let you near him!

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:15.250
Thinking about it, you're one too,
as is Princess Takiyasha.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.250
Same with Taira Masakado for that matter...

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.590
The afterlife is full of curse gods.

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:26.800
No matter whether those people
think of themselves that way...

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.810
Welcome back, Hozuki.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.520
Mr. Hozuki!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:42.820
Take us to the Maki Miki concert!

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:45.900
Mr. Hozuki! Let's go eat some meat!

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:47.490
Take us there!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:54.410
Come on! Let's have some meat!
Take us there! Take us there! Take us there!

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:10.600
Uso yo. Janakya naze koko ni tadoritsuku no?
That's a lie. If not, why do you find your way here?

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:17.230
Enma-sama no mae de nao shira o kiru no ne
Even in front of Lord Enma, you feign ignorance

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:23.150
Baka ne. Dakedo sonna toko tamaranakute
You're an idiot. But I can't get enough of that aspect of you

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:29.530
Teitaraku. Onaji tsumi kasanetsuzuketa
What a predicament. You continued to repeat the same sin

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:34.830
Ii no? Yubikiri genman.
Is that alright? Pinky swear.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:36.200
(E?)
(Huh?)
Ii no? Yubikiri genman.
Is that alright? Pinky swear.

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:41.040
Gachi ni honto ni naru yo.
It will seriously become reality.

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:42.630
(Dogii!)
(Startling!)
Gachi ni honto ni naru yo.
It will seriously become reality.

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:49.050
Tensei o matazu shounetsu no mama ni
Without waiting for reincarnation, while still in the scorching heat

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:55.060
Asa hiru eien ai o kushizashi narabete
Morning, midday, and eternally skewer desires and line them up

00:22:55.310 --> 00:22:58.230
Gutsu gutsu mou! Nie nie da yo
Already simmering! It's boiling

00:22:58.480 --> 00:23:01.650
Yuuge wa jigoku de hot pot
Supper is a hot pot in Hell

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:07.860
Nita mono doushi ni oniai no oshioki
For people who are alike, a suitable punishment

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:10.990
Juu juu achi! Koge koge da yo
Sizzling hot! It's burned to a crisp

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:14.280
Anata to jigoku de hotcake
Hotcakes with you in Hell

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:19.710
Tokoyo no suna ni naru made
Until they become forever-unchanging sand

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:26.840
NEXT TIME
ON HOZUKI'S
COOLHEADEDNESS...

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:28.630
People in fairy tales are born
from all kinds of things, aren't they?

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:28.590
AND

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:31.760
Momotaro was born from a peach,
and Princess Uriko was born from a melon.

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:31.550
BUT

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:33.600
Lots of birds make appearances, too.

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:35.390
The crane is probably among
the most famous examples.

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:34.550
SO

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:39.060
Oh my, Mr. Hozuki, you've got the sort of looks
that make you a target for trouble with women...

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.730
WE PRESENT:
AMANOJAKU
AND
GO HOME, CRANE

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.730
PLEASE ENJOY!
